َّيْنَ", "plain": "تَلَقَّيْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/874c8f0d57b24e4b48ec.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "2:37", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/44.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Then Adam received from his Lord words (of revelation), and He relented toward him. Lo! He is the relenting, the Merciful.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Derken Âdem Rabb'ından birtakım kelimeler aldı, (onlarla tevbe etti. O da) tevbesini kabul etti. Muhakkak O, tevbeyi çok kabul eden, çok esirgeyendir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "پھر سیکھ لیے آدم نے اپنے رب سے کچھ کلمے تو اللہ نے اس کی توبہ قبول کی بیشک وہی ہے بہت توبہ قبول کرنے والا مہربان۔", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Kemudian Adam menerima beberapa kalimat dari Tuhannya, maka Allah menerima taubatnya. Sesungguhnya Allah Maha Penerima taubat lagi Maha Penyayang.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَتَلَقَّىٰٓ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8b6b594316c4678bb51b.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa je primio", "en": "then received", "tr": "sonra aldı", "fr": "alors il a reçu", "id": "lalu menerima", "ur": "پس اس نے وصول کیا", "bn": "অতঃপর সে গ্রহণ করল", "fa": "آن‌گاه دریافت کرد"}}, {"text": "ءَادَمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَّبِّهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَلِمَٰتٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَتَابَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلتَّوَّابُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "21:103", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2586.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "The Supreme Horror will not grieve them, and the angels will welcome them, (saying): This is your Day which ye were promised;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O en büyük korku bunları üzmez; kendilerini melekler: \"Size söz verilen gün işte bugündür\" diye karşılarlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "انہیں غم میں نہ ڈالے گی وہ سب سے بڑی گھبراہٹ اور فرشتے ان کی پیشوائی کو آئیں گے کہ یہ ہے تمہارا وہ دن جس کا تم سے وعدہ تھا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka tidak disusahkan oleh kedahsyatan yang besar (pada hari kiamat), dan mereka disambut oleh para malaikat. (Malaikat berkata): \"Inilah harimu yang telah dijanjikan kepadamu\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَحْزُنُهُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْفَزَعُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَكْبَرُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَتَتَلَقَّىٰهُمُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8b5cbfa84d9abb452382.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i dočekat će ih", "en": "and will meet them", "tr": "ve onları karşılayacak", "fr": "et les accueilleront", "id": "dan akan menyambut mereka", "ur": "اور وہ ان کا استقبال کریں گے", "bn": "এবং তাদের অভ্যর্থনা জানাবে", "fa": "و به استقبال آنان خواهد رفت"}}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَوْمُكُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُوعَدُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "50:17", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4647.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "When the two Receivers receive (him), seated on the right hand and on the left,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onun sağında ve solunda oturmuş iki melek zabıt tutarken,", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور جب اس سے لیتے ہیں دو لینے والے ایک داہنے بیٹھا اور ایک بائیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(yaitu) ketika dua orang malaikat mencatat amal perbuatannya, seorang duduk di sebelah kanan dan yang lain duduk di sebelah kiri.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِذْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَتَلَقَّى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/e7ab1a5857ac86f93f78.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "primaju", "en": "receive", "tr": "alıyorlar", "fr": "reçoivent", "id": "menerima", "ur": "وہ وصول کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা গ্রহণ করে", "fa": "دریافت می‌کنند"}}, {"text": "ٱلْمُتَلَقِّيَانِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْيَمِينِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَعَنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلشِّمَالِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَعِيدٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "فَتَلَقَّىٰٓ", "count": 1, "first": "2:37", "audio": "audio/8b6b594316c4678bb51b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "pa je primio", "en": "then received", "tr": "sonra aldı", "fr